## Observed runtime lessons (self-discovered, not user corrections)

- On this machine the VS Code terminal capture channel reports "completion could not be observed" and exit code 1 even when stdout shows success; trust parsed stdout markers, not `$LASTEXITCODE`. Evidence: repeated probe runs 2026-11-11. Scope: this workspace/terminal setup only.
- Client-side model labels in agent configs can be aliases that disagree with the serving endpoint's own model registry; query the endpoint (`/v1/models`, `base_model_id`) for the weights-level truth. Evidence: Modal endpoint response 2026-11-11. Scope: OpenAI-compatible deployments.
- The `ep-glm-5-3-flash-nvfp4-server` Modal stream emits chunks with an empty `choices` list (terminal/usage chunks); indexing `chunk.choices[0]` unguarded raises IndexError after the payload has already streamed. Guard with `if not chunk.choices: continue`. Evidence: smoke run of `examples/modal_glm_client.py` 2026-11-11 (crash before fix, clean after). Scope: this endpoint's stream shape; other OpenAI-compatible servers may differ.
- Settings files owned by a running app are moving targets: Cline's UI rewrote `providers.json`/`globalState.json` between consecutive reads (apiKey prefix and model id changed mid-session). Re-read immediately before surgical edits and re-verify from disk after, never from in-memory diffs. Evidence: fix sequence 2026-11-11. Scope: agent harness state files.
- "Model list shows none" in an agent UI = selected model id ??? `GET {baseUrl}/models`; auth and chat can be perfectly healthy while the list stays empty. Fix by aligning baseUrl AND every persisted selection field (per-provider settings plus per-mode state), verified by a membership check. Evidence: Cline modal provider 2026-11-11. Scope: providers whose UI fetches lists from baseUrl.
- Reasoning-serving endpoints spend tiny `max_tokens` budgets entirely on reasoning tokens, returning empty content (8-token probe ??? 14 reasoning, no text). Probe with ???256 tokens before concluding the endpoint is broken. Evidence: GLM endpoint probes 2026-11-11.
- Security note: `~/.cline/data/settings/providers.json` stores live API keys and OAuth tokens in plaintext; never echo its secret values into responses or logs. Evidence: file read 2026-11-11 (secrets withheld).
